    "title": "Beloved Ethiopian Restaurant To Close After Nearly 30 Years - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By MCS Staff ,\n1 hours ago Dukem Ethiopian Restaurant, a longtime fixture at 1114-1118 U Street NW in Washington, D.C., has announced that it will close after nearly 30 years in business. The restaurant’s final day of service, including its upstairs lounge, will be Saturday, November 7. Dukem traces its history back to 1997, when... Read full article",
